      "settings": {
        "text_width": "wide",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<h2>Benefits of Choosing Hearns Hobbies for Your RC Scenery Needs</h2><p>When you choose Hearns Hobbies, you're not just getting high-quality products; you're also benefiting from our decades of expertise and passion for the hobby. Here's why we stand out:</p><ul><li><strong>Extensive Selection</strong>: We offer a vast range of scenery options to suit all types of RC vehicles.</li><li><strong>Quality Products</strong>: Our scenery items are made from durable materials that withstand regular use.</li><li><strong>Expert Advice</strong>: Our team of experienced hobbyists is always ready to help you select the best scenery for your needs.</li><li><strong>Local Convenience</strong>: As one of Melbourne's oldest hobby shops, we provide a trusted local source for all your RC needs.</li></ul><p>Our wide selection and expert guidance make us your go-to destination for all things RC. Visit us in our store or browse through our collection online, and explore options for your hobby needs today.</p>",
